==Icelandic==
{{cardinalbox|is|0|1|2|tíu|tólf|ord=ellefti}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|ellifu|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*ainalif}}, a compound of {{term/t|gem-pro|*ainaz}} and {{term/t|gem-pro|*lif-}}. Compare Faroese {{term|ellivu|lang=fo}}, Norwegian and Danish {{term|elleve|lang=no}}, Swedish {{term|elva|lang=sv}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɛtlɛvʏ/|lang=is}}

===Cardinal number===
{{head|is|numeral}}

# [[eleven]]; the cardinal number after [[tíu#Icelandic|tíu]] and before [[tólf#Icelandic|tólf]].

